## 🏨 NEW CLUSTER C2: Hospital & OPD Management (`cat_040` — NEW CATEGORY)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This category is designed to serve **BOTH Big Multi-Specialty Hospitals AND Small Single-Doctor OPD Clinics**. The dashboard auto-adapts based on a **Tier System**: the owner selects their tier at registration, and the UI shows only relevant modules.

### Tier System
| Tier | Example | Modules Shown |
|------|---------|---------------|
| **Tier 1: Small OPD Clinic** | Dr. Sharma's Clinic (1-3 doctors) | Simple token queue, basic patient records, single-department booking, prescription pad |
| **Tier 2: Polyclinic** | City Health Center (4-10 doctors, 2-5 depts) | Multi-department booking, lab referral, pharmacy link, staff roster |
| **Tier 3: Big Hospital** | Apollo/Sahyadri-level (10+ doctors, 10+ depts) | Full OPD system, wards, ICU, blood bank, ambulance fleet, insurance/TPA, health packages |

