## 📸 MEGA FEATURE: Smart Shopping List & OCR Order System (All Retail Categories)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a **flagship feature** for all Product-based retail shops (Grocery, Pharmacy, Hardware, Stationery, etc.). It allows visitors to submit orders via handwritten list photos or manual text entry. The shop owner reviews, prices, and accepts/rejects them.

### How It Works — Visitor Side

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│          📋 SMART LIST ORDER                     │
│                                                  │
│  Choose how to submit your shopping list:        │
│                                                  │
│  ┌─────────────────┐  ┌─────────────────┐       │
│  │  📷 Capture /    │  │  ⌨️ Type Your   │       │
│  │  Upload Photo    │  │  List Manually  │       │
│  │  of Handwritten  │  │                 │       │
│  │  List            │  │  - Dal 1kg      │       │
│  │                  │  │  - Rice 5kg     │       │
│  │  [Take Photo]    │  │  - Sugar 2kg    │       │
│  └─────────────────┘  └─────────────────┘       │
│                                                  │
│  Order Type: 🏪 Self-Pickup Only (Bulk Order)    │
│  Special Notes: ___________________________      │
│                                                  │
│  [Submit List to Shop Owner →]                   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Step-by-step Visitor Flow:**
1. **Option A — Photo Upload:** User clicks a photo of their handwritten shopping list (paper note, diary page, etc.) using camera or file upload.
2. **OCR Processing:** The system uses Tesseract.js (client-side OCR) to extract text from the image and displays it as a formatted list.
3. **Option B — Manual Typing:** User types items line-by-line in a text area (e.g., "Dal 1kg, Rice 5kg, Sugar 2kg").
4. **Review & Submit:** User reviews the extracted/typed list and submits it as a **Self-Pickup Bulk Order** to the shop owner.
5. **Both the original image AND the converted text** are sent to the shop owner.

### How It Works — Shop Owner Side

```
